---
to: "lib/ash_a2a.ex"
---
<%#
  LEGACY DISCLOSURE (v26.9.10 finish-all pass): this template hand-renders
  raw Elixir source (defmodule/%Spark.Dsl.Entity{} literals) via a `to:`
  frontmatter -- the pattern ggen_igniter's own AGENTS.md doctrine calls
  superseded/refused (the admitted pattern composes an Igniter.Mix.Task
  that calls real Ash/Igniter generators, never hand-emits Ash/Spark DSL
  source directly). This template predates that doctrine, has never been
  run through `mix ggen_igniter.sync` (see MANUFACTURING_RECEIPT.md's
  disclosed blocker), and must not be copied as an example of how a new
  ggen_igniter consumer should structure its own templates. See
  ontology.ttl's matching disclosure at the top of that file.
%>
<%#
  Generated Spark.Dsl.Extension -- mirrors ash-extension-core-pack's
  extension.ex.tmpl shape (packs/ash-extension-core-pack/templates/extension.ex.tmpl),
  translated from Tera {% %} syntax to EEx <%= %>/<% %> per the ggen-igniter-eex
  research finding: struct module + nested Argument struct module + two
  %Spark.Dsl.Entity{} module attributes (@argument nested under @skill via
  entities: [arguments: [@argument]]) + one %Spark.Dsl.Section{} + `use
  Spark.Dsl.Extension`. Skill args/schema mirror ash_ai's real @tool entity
  (~/xaas/deps/ash_ai/lib/ash_ai/dsl.ex:228-268, args: [:name, {:optional,
  :resource}, :action]) and its nested @tool_argument (target
  AshAi.Tool.Argument, ~/xaas/deps/ash_ai/lib/ash_ai.ex:46-58: name, type,
  description, default, allow_nil?). Echoes admitted PRD/ARD facts (FR1-FR2,
  §3.1, §3.4); does not invent new DSL shape.
%>
defmodule <%= @skill_struct %> do
  @moduledoc false

  @enforce_keys [:name, :action]

  defstruct [
    :name,
    :resource,
    :action,
    :arguments,
    :__identifier__,
    :__spark_metadata__
  ]
end

defmodule <%= @argument_struct %> do
  @moduledoc false

  @enforce_keys [:name, :type]

  defstruct [
    :name,
    :type,
    :description,
    :__identifier__,
    :__spark_metadata__,
    default: nil,
    allow_nil?: true
  ]
end

defmodule <%= @module_name %> do
  @moduledoc """
  Spark.Dsl.Extension for `<%= @package_name %>`.

  Manufactured by ggen from an admitted ash_a2a:AshExtensionSpec -- do not
  hand-edit; regenerate from the ontology instead.
  """

  @<%= @argument_entity %> %Spark.Dsl.Entity{
    name: :<%= @argument_entity %>,
    target: <%= @argument_struct %>,
    args: [:name, :type],
    describe: "An argument accepted by this skill's underlying Ash action.",
    schema: [
      name: [type: :atom, required: true, doc: "The argument's atom name."],
      type: [type: :any, required: true, doc: "The argument's Ash/Spark type."],
      description: [type: :string, required: false, doc: "Human-readable description of the argument."],
      default: [type: :any, required: false, default: nil, doc: "Default value used when the argument is omitted."],
      allow_nil?: [type: :boolean, required: false, default: true, doc: "Whether nil is an acceptable value for this argument."]
    ]
  }

  @<%= @skill_entity %> %Spark.Dsl.Entity{
    name: :<%= @skill_entity %>,
    target: <%= @skill_struct %>,
    args: [:name, {:optional, :resource}, :action],
    identifier: :name,
    describe: """
    Expose an Ash resource/domain action as an A2A-discoverable agent skill.
    """,
    entities: [
      arguments: [@<%= @argument_entity %>]
    ],
    schema: [
      name: [type: :atom, required: true, doc: "The skill's atom name."],
      resource: [type: :module, required: false, doc: "The Ash resource this skill's action belongs to. Optional and context-normalized: implicit on a resource-level declaration, required on a domain-level declaration."],
      action: [type: :atom, required: true, doc: "The Ash action this skill invokes on its resource."]
    ]
  }

  @skills %Spark.Dsl.Section{
    name: :a2a,
    describe: "Declare Ash resource/domain actions as A2A-discoverable agent skills.",
    entities: [
      @<%= @skill_entity %>
    ]
  }

  use Spark.Dsl.Extension,
    sections: [@skills],
    transformers: [<%= @module_name %>.Persist],
    verifiers: [<%= @module_name %>.Verify]
end
